cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TensorMixedStates.jl
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the article that describes it and the codebase
  release that article documents, which is what SciPost Physics Codebases asks for.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Julia library to simulate closed and open quantum systems, pure and mixed states, using
  matrix product states. It implements the MPS representation of the density matrix and its
  operations, time evolution under a Lindblad equation or under non-unitary gates, ground
  states by DMRG, and an expressive syntax for operators, observables, Hamiltonians and
  Lindbladians.
